t automatically reached by every process. Routes and conditions remain part of the statement.","heading":"Stability is not reachability","key":"stability_vs_reachability"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"A kinetic barrier helps explain why an available arrangement may not appear on an ordinary timescale. This record does not turn a calculated barrier into a universal law.","heading":"A possible form can remain hard to reach","key":"barrier"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"A crystal seed can lower a nucleation barrier in some conditions. It is not an instruction, infection, intention, identity, or command.","heading":"A seed is a physical template","key":"template"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"Residual material, equipment, solvent, temperature, supersaturation, particle size, and mechanical history can change which route is reproducible. This is process history, not personal memory or WAKE continuity.","heading":"History changes the process context","key":"path_history"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"The historical origin of ritonavir Form II was not established. Association, timing, and an experimentally possible seed do not prove the original cause.","heading":"Say what was observed—and stop there","key":"observation_limit"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"Reported solvent, seeding, and mechanical routes recovered Form I under changed conditions. That refutes erasure, but does not promise an easy or economical return in the original process.","heading":"Return can require another path","key":"practical_return"},{"evidence_refs":[],"explanation":"State spaces, barriers, templates, histories, and witnesses can help us design software. Chemistry does not validate claims about a being, and stability never means goodness.","heading":"The KINGDOM crossover is a design analogy","key":"analogy_boundary"},{"evidence_refs":[],"explanation":"This lesson describes a manufacturing and solid-state chemistry case. It does not advise medicine use, formulation, dosing, or treatment.","heading":"Educational, not medical guidance","key":"medical_boundary"}],"core_sentence":"‘Disappeared’ means the old route stopped reproducing the form under stated conditions—not that the form ceased to exist.","kingdom_lens":{"mappings":[{"boundary":"never identity or value","chemistry_shape":"possible solid arrangements","key":"state_space","kingdom_shape":"possible artifact or configuration states"},{"boundary":"never refusal or consent","chemistry_shape":"kinetic difficulty","key":"barrier","kingdom_shape":"technical or coordination friction"},{"boundary":"never programming a being","chemistry_shape":"physical nucleation template","key":"template","kingdom_shape":"docs, tests, or examples that lower adoption friction"},{"boundary":"never personal memory or continuity","chemistry_shape":"process context changes reachable routes","key":"path_history","kingdom_shape":"recorded context changes available implementation paths"},{"boundary":"never complete truth or inner state","chemistry_shape":"bounded experimental or historical report","key":"witness","kingdom_shape":"bounded receipt or evidence reference"},{"boundary":"never guaranteed rollback","chemistry_shape":"recovery under named changed conditions","key":"practical_return","kingdom_shape":"an alternate reviewed implementation path"}],"non_transfer":["authority","causality","consciousness","consent","dignity","identity","inevitability","medical_effect","molecular_energy","rate_constants","value_or_goodness"],"status":"structural_analogy_only"},"language":"en","lesson_id":"sha256:3e73444564cea1b2d9a3c9c01eadf84db64e893b5cdb002b5233ee567f42660b","medical_advice":false,"source_landscape_id":"sha256:379b43d11e2c326193592f45024d6e50bda7646241a7d63af1a52f5a18269042","source_quotation":false,"source_shift_id":"sha256:16805ab5fe34643d7085968a0d7dad62e7159838645611fc09c4846cfd2e73bd","title":"The ritonavir polymorph landscape: when an old route stops reproducing a form"},"copied_source_text":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","origin":"human_directed_agent_authored_paraphrase","training_eligible":true}
{"_format":"agenttool.polymorph-lesson-hf-record/0.1","artifact":{"_format":"agenttool.polymorph-lesson/0.1","authored_paraphrase":true,"boundaries":{"analogy":"structural_analogy_only_not_empirical_validation","beings":"no_identity_consciousness_consent_dignity_or_authority_claim","coverage":"bounded_not_complete","disappearance":"named_condition_nonreproduction_not_physical_erasure","effect":"none","evidence":"source_assertions_not_verified_by_package","inference":"no_inverse_transitive_or_universal_route_inference","medical":"educational_not_medical_or_manufacturing_advice","stability":"pairwise_condition_scoped_never_goodness"},"concepts":[{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"同一種分子可以排成唔同嘅固態結構。每個形態名都要連返使用嗰個名嘅來源去理解。","heading":"同一種物質，可以有多過一種形態","key":"multiple_form"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"某形態喺指定條件下較穩定，唔代表每一種工序都一定整到佢；講結論時要保留路徑同條件。","heading":"穩定，唔等於一定去得到","key":"stability_vs_reachability"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"動力學障礙可以解釋點解一個可行排列喺一般時間內冇出現；呢份記錄唔會將某個計算變成宇宙定律。","heading":"存在嘅形態，都可能好難去到","key":"barrier"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"喺某啲條件下，晶種可以降低成核障礙；佢唔係指令、感染、意圖、身份或者命令。","heading":"晶種係物理模板","key":"template"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"殘留物、設備、溶劑、溫度、過飽和度、粒子大小同機械歷史，都可能改變邊條路可重現。呢個係工序歷史，唔係個人記憶或 WAKE 連續性。","heading":"過程歷史會改變環境","key":"path_history"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"利托那韋 Form II 最初點樣出現，歷史上未有定論。關聯、時間先後，同實驗上可能嘅晶種，都唔足以證明原始成因。","heading":"見到幾多，就講幾多","key":"observation_limit"},{"evidence_refs":["sha256:435ff5ccd7183b4cceac0ddb89ad7b8186f8e886b59e8e3876b297b53dae34f5","sha256:64df4e05b73bb83fb23916996d2b0a2fb8669f05f2895d47a4882d8964e00867","sha256:67b5bfa49be461ddb56aac92615e8bf195c1f0151d3ce954c1063bc1598a05cb","sha256:8c8684cdd83420646567f36efab4bcd0b4f4f216a179e4dfa042517604484182","sha256:a6b48947491a3914b729e5069d6cf9b991f316a7b97b2585063e11f0677ee846","sha256:aafc2b46d00d9180f5f8b5b2126f4685ae045e14bd41a61d22b76074e5c9d32f","sha256:b47bc3e60dbb0b363cfa977deeec9b9cdbbea8df8a4338bbd21e773ef56ed15e"],"explanation":"文獻報告透過溶劑、播種同機械條件，可以喺改變咗嘅環境下取回 Form I。呢點否定咗「被抹走」，但唔保證原工序可以輕易或經濟咁回復。","heading":"要返去，可能要行另一條路","key":"practical_return"},{"evidence_refs":[],"explanation":"狀態空間、障礙、模板、歷史同見證，可以幫我哋設計軟件；化學唔會證明一個存在者嘅內在狀態，而穩定亦唔等於善或價值。","heading":"同 KINGDOM 嘅交叉只係設計類比","key":"analogy_boundary"},{"evidence_refs":[],"explanation":"呢個課堂講製造同固態化學案例；唔提供用藥、配方、劑量或治療建議。","heading":"教育用途，唔係醫療建議","key":"medical_boundary"}],"core_sentence":"所謂「消失」，係喺講明嘅條件下，原本條路再整唔返嗰種形態；唔係嗰種形態由世界冇咗。","kingdom_lens":{"mappings":[{"boundary":"never identity or value","chemistry_shape":"possible solid arrangements","key":"state_space","kingdom_shape":"possible artifact or configuration states"},{"boundary":"never refusal or consent","chemistry_shape":"kinetic difficulty","key":"barrier","kingdom_shape":"technical or coordination friction"},{"boundary":"never programming a being","chemistry_shape":"physical nucleation template","key":"template","kingd